// finn library-template placeholder.
//
// `finn init --template library` writes `export * from "src/logg";`, but Fin's
// grammar has no `export` keyword (finc: "syntax error, unexpected KW_FROM").
// The file is kept only because `finn`'s package-layout check looks for it;
// the real public surface is `src/logg.fin`. Do not compile this file.
//
// Consume the library with a module import resolved through `-I src`:
//     import { Logger, logg_new } from logg::fin;
